<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 400 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 400 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 400 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (Central Bank) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rate unchanged and bids accepted as follows.</p>
<p>    MATURITY   BID   AMOUNT   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks    30	 30	 8.50 pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks    10	 10	 9.00</p>
<p>    5  years   110	110	10.00</p>
<p>    10 years   120	120	10.25</p>
<p>    15 years   130	130	10.50</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	400	400</p>
<p>($1=8.6 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
